{"sha": "5d28dfeb25a22c0b8734576c3dd7c019f5593af159ea8e76b1b6379dd3312750", "body": ["\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g5:raw-materials-and-recycling:2}", "说出下列物品的原料：一张纸、一个玻璃罐、一件棉质", "T恤、一个塑料瓶。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g5:raw-materials-and-recycling:3}", "什么是矿石？写出铝的矿石名称。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g5:raw-materials-and-recycling:4}", "下列物品应放入哪个回收箱：空果酱瓶、报纸、饮料罐、", "塑料水瓶？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g5:raw-materials-and-recycling:5}", "观察材料生命周期图，橙色循环", "箭头代替的是什么？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g5:raw-materials-and-recycling:6}", "判断下列物质哪些是可再生的：木材、原油、羊毛、铁矿石、棉花？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g5:raw-materials-and-recycling:7}", "为什么把玻璃冷却后不能变回沙子？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g5:raw-materials-and-recycling:8}", "请各举一种方法：减少、再利用、回收利用各一种。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g5:raw-materials-and-recycling:9}", "为什么玻璃回收箱只能放玻璃？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g5:raw-materials-and-recycling:10}", "用旧罐头盒制铝所需的能量，约为用铝土矿制铝所需能量的二十分之一。", "某工厂用铝土矿制作一批铝需要 20 单位能量。", "若改用旧罐头盒制作同样一批铝，", "大约需要多少单位能量？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g5:raw-materials-and-recycling:11}", "为什么“减少”排在“回收利用”前面？", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}